{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And HaShem will dispossess.</b> You do what is upon you, and I too will do what is upon Me (there)." "<b>And mightier than you.</b> You are mighty — and they are mightier than you. For if Israel were not mighty, what praise would it be to praise the Amorites by saying ״וְעֲצוּמִים מִכֶּם״? Rather: you are mighty compared to the other nations, and they are mightier than you (see there)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:37.748237942Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}